The device driver layer (src/drivers) adapts patterns from:
- simvyn (https://github.com/pranshuchittora/simvyn), MIT — adb device discovery and command shapes.
- sim-use (https://github.com/lycorp-jp/sim-use), Apache-2.0 — the Android device bridge HTTP protocol and tree-first verification loop.
